## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/

# Release-channel SOURCE (ADR 0006) — these are source dirs, not bin/obj build output. The
# [Rr]elease(s)/ rules above (meant for build folders) would otherwise swallow them.
!setup/release/
# The session release tools (get-release.sh, dev-image.sh) are source too, and were swallowed the same way.
!tools/release/
!src/Fravashi.Launcher/Releases/
!tests/Fravashi.Launcher.Tests/Releases/
# Work item #368: a project's releases (the tracker record, its store, its tests) are source the same way.
!src/Fravashi.Domain/Releases/
!src/Fravashi.Application/Releases/
!src/Fravashi.Infrastructure/Releases/
!tests/Fravashi.Domain.Tests/Releases/
!tests/Fravashi.Application.Tests/Releases/
!tests/Fravashi.Infrastructure.Tests/Releases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# Self-contained installer bundles produced by setup/build-bundle.* (image tarball + published launcher)
/setup/dist/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Rescope archive: obsolete docs/plans/agent-files kept on disk, never committed (see ADR 0003)
/archive/

# Exploratory native artifact-model design draft — kept on disk, never committed (owner intent)
docs/drafts/domain/
# Playwright MCP session debris (snapshots/logs from browser-driven verification)
/.playwright-mcp/
